# SHOWSTOPPER: the first bosses. The Snow Engine strafes its yard, takes
# hits anywhere, lets out a clockwork mouse and brings snowballs in. Granny
# Goggle is only hurt in the eye (her head stops shots), her gloves throw
# fire and volleys and turn into spiked balls that hunt. The Boiler backs
# up the winding road with the view going after it; only its turret takes
# hits, and with it gone the view is free. The Doppels share one bar and
# change shape together: urchins, devil faces, aliens laying spike blocks.
# Every boss shows itself for a moment before it fights.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat god
cheat cam 1232
cheat arena
cheat pos 152 1360
cheat boss 1 152 1272
expect boss_kind == 1
expect boss_hp == 150
expect boss_maxhp == 150
cheat face 6
hold A 60
release A
expect boss_hp < 150
waituntil kind_26 >= 1 200
waituntil kind_9 >= 1 200
cheat killboss
wait 2
expect boss == 0
# Granny Goggle
cheat cam 0
cheat arena
cheat nobullets
cheat pos 152 140
cheat boss 2 152 40
expect boss_hp == 220
wait 100
cheat face 6
press A 1
wait 30
expect boss_hp == 219
# from the side, at her head: stopped
cheat pos 30 22
cheat face 0
press A 1
wait 40
expect boss_hp == 219
cheat bossphase 2 10
wait 20
expect part2_a == 1
cheat killboss
wait 100
# the Boiler: the chase up the road
cheat stage 3
cheat god
cheat cam 2048
wait 2
expect boss_kind == 3
expect chasing == 1
expect boss_hp == 170
wait 200
expect cam < 2038
cheat killboss
wait 2
expect chasing == 0
expect cam_lock == -1
wait 100
# the Doppels: two, one bar
cheat cam 0
cheat arena
cheat nobullets
cheat boss 4 120 40
expect part0_alive == 1
expect part1_alive == 1
expect boss_hp == 300
wait 92
cheat bossphase 2 0
wait 30
expect kind_31 >= 4
cheat bossphase 0 419
wait 2
expect boss_phase == 1
